Cambodia has many amazing places. Angkor Thom has giant stone faces. Phnom Kulen has a holy waterfall. In Phnom Penh, you can visit the Silver Pagoda next to the Mekong. You can watch the sunset on the Kampot river, eat crab at Kep beach and swim at Koh Rong. Ratanakiri lake is round and blue.

